<div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color:#0f172a; line-height:1.6; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto;">
  <div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2699A6 0%, #1d7a85 100%); padding: 30px; text-align: center;">
    <h1 style="color: #ffffff; margin: 0; font-size: 28px;">Welcome to Ambersand!</h1>
  </div>

  <div style="background: #ffffff; padding: 40px 30px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;">
    <h2 style="margin: 0 0 20px; color: #0f172a; font-size: 24px;">Verify Your Email Address</h2>

    <p style="margin: 0 0 20px; color: #475569; font-size: 16px;">
      Hi {{userName}},
    </p>

    <p style="margin: 0 0 20px; color: #475569; font-size: 16px;">
      Thank you for creating an Ambersand account. To complete your registration and start using our compliance management platform, please verify your email address.
    </p>

    <div style="text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;">
      <a href="{{verificationUrl}}"
         style="background: #2699A6; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; padding: 14px 32px; border-radius: 6px; display: inline-block; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px;">
        Verify Email Address
      </a>
    </div>

    <p style="margin: 20px 0 10px; color: #64748b; font-size: 14px;">
      If the button doesn't work, copy and paste this link into your browser:
    </p>
    <p style="margin: 0; color: #2699A6; font-size: 14px; word-break: break-all;">
      {{verificationUrl}}
    </p>

    <div style="margin-top: 40px; padding-top: 20px; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;">
      <p style="margin: 0 0 10px; color: #64748b; font-size: 14px;">
        <strong>Important:</strong> This verification link will expire in 24 hours.
      </p>
      <p style="margin: 0; color: #64748b; font-size: 14px;">
        If you didn't create an account with Ambersand, please ignore this email.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="background: #f8fafc; padding: 20px 30px; text-align: center; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-top: none;">
    <p style="margin: 0; color: #94a3b8; font-size: 12px;">
      © 2025 Ambersand Compliance. All rights reserved.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
